<title>UK: Pilkington shares fall after results.</title>
<headline>Pilkington shares fall after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilkington Plc shares dipped on Thursday following sharply lower 1996/97 results.</p>
<p>By 0900 GMT the shares were trading 5.0p lower at 119p after the glass-maker posted a pre-tax profit of 132 million stg, down from 212 million the previous financial year.</p>
<p>The result fell within market expectations but dealers said the stock was still suffering from disappointment at the results performance. -- London newsroom, +44-171-542-7717</p>
